  "npcs": [
    {
      "id":"museum.curator","type":"folk.curator","tile":[14,14],"facing":"south",
      "props":{"name":"Mina Vellum","title":"Museum Curator","roam":4},
      "dialog":{"start":"welcome","nodes":{
        "welcome":{"text":"Welcome. Every creature displayed here began with somebody paying close attention outside these walls.","then":"menu"},
        "menu":{"text":"What would you like to know?","choices":[
          {"text":"How do the exhibits grow?","to":"exhibits"},
          {"text":"What is downstairs?","to":"cellar"},
          {"text":"I will look around.","to":"goodbye"}
        ]},
        "exhibits":{"text":"Catch a species for the first time and we prepare an exhibit. Later discoveries strengthen the record, even when the gallery needs only one representative.","then":"menu"},
        "cellar":{"text":"Officially, archival storage. Unofficially, Marrow keeps a card table down there. The collections committee has elected not to inspect too closely.","then":"menu"},
        "goodbye":{"text":"Take your time. A museum should reward a slow walk.","then":"end"}
      },"greetings":{
        "acquaintance":[
          "The fish gallery has a new tank on the end. It is empty, which is a polite way of saying it is waiting on you.",
          "Mind the wet patch by the fish gallery. The exhibits are sealed; the mop is not.",
          "We had a school group through. They asked which animal was the oldest. I said the curator.",
          "The collections committee meets in the lobby, mostly to agree that the benches need replacing."
        ],
        "friend":[
          "Half the labels in the game gallery have your name on the collector line now. The engraver is getting tired of it.",
          "Marrow sent up a note asking for better lamps in the cellar. I sent down a note asking what he needs to see so clearly.",
          "A visitor asked whether the museum buys specimens. I said we accept them from people who pay attention. Then I thought of you.",
          "The committee wants a plaque for the top donor. I have not told them it would just be your name and a very long list."
        ],
        "close":[
          "Come in. I have kept the bench that does not wobble for you.",
          "You have walked these galleries slower than anyone, myself included. That is the highest praise I have.",
          "Nothing new in the cases this week. It is still good to see the person who filled most of them."
        ]
      }}
    }
  ],
  "exits": [{"tile":[14,20]},{"tile":[15,20]}],
